OL,3,GWest Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will be a
OL,6,Fcloudy evening with the odd patch of
OL,7,Flight rain. The rain will become
OL,8,Fheavier and more persistent from the
OL,9,Fsouth overnight, and it will turn
OL,10,Fbreezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSaturday will be an
OL,13,Funsettled day. It will be cloudy and
OL,14,Fbreezy with outbreaks of rain, some of
OL,15,Fwhich will be heavy, especially around
OL,16,Fthe middle of the day.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
